<#f0f000>:Archer (Emiya) - simplified commands:</>
<#a0a0a0>:P6 build: hold a direction + one free key.:>
<#a0a0a0>:Real KOF motions return at delivery.:>


<#f0f000>:Normal Attacks:</>
Light Slash              (A)					^X
Front Kick               (B)					^A
Kanshou-Bakuya Slash     (C) - long reach		^Y
Roundhouse               (D)					^B
Crouch Heavy Slash       (C) - anti-air			_D_+^Y
Taunt											^S


<#f0f000>:Throws:</>
Forward Throw									_F_+^Y
Forward Throw									_F_+^B
Back Throw										_B_+^Y
Back Throw										_B_+^B


<#f0f000>:Special Moves (simplified):</>
Arrow Shot               (projectile)			_D_+^C
Twin Arrow               (EX, 500 Power)		_B_+^C
Rising Slash             (anti-air)				_F_+^C


<#f0f000>:Super Moves (simplified):</>
Broken Phantasm          (1000 Power, 3 shots)	_D_+^Z
Unlimited Blade Works    (2000 Power, swords)	_B_+^Z


<#f0f000>:Real commands (restored at delivery):</>
Arrow Shot										_D_, _DF_, _F_, ^X
Twin Arrow										_D_, _DF_, _F_, ^Y
Rising Slash									_F_, _D_, _DF_, ^X
Broken Phantasm									_D_, _DF_, _F_, _D_, _DF_, _F_, ^X
Unlimited Blade Works							_B_, _DB_, _D_, _B_, _DB_, _D_, ^X


<#a0a0a0>:Buttons: X=Light Punch, A=Light Kick,</>
<#a0a0a0>:Y=Heavy Punch, B=Heavy Kick. The specials use</>
<#a0a0a0>:the Z and C buttons, which the four-button</>
<#a0a0a0>:normals never use, so they never clash.:>
